.TH tkutablelist n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkutablelist \- multi-column table (optional; requires Tablelist)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkutablelist
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkutablelist::widget .w -columns {Name Age}]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A wrapper around the Tablelist megawidget with a rows/columns API, click-to-sort
headers, frozen title columns and CSV loading via tclutils::tucsv. OPTIONAL: not
part of the umbrella. See docs/tkutablelist.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n), tucsv
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, table, tablelist
